{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Behold, YHWH tosses you.</b> Doubled [form], from ויטלטלו הכלים (Jonah 1:5)." "<b>Tossing.</b> You, who think that you are mighty, in the sense of והיית לאיש (1 Kings 2:2) — and here it is like the form of a call or of tossing, like טלטול גבר, and the first [interpretation] is closer to me."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:42.707936710Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}